# PvP corridor border segment: solid indestructible 10 m block. The Game layer rings the arena
# with a row of these (deterministic local spawn on every instance - no network, no gameplay
# role), parented under the Ground entity to keep the scene root lean.
Prefab gameBorderWall
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Cube
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.45 0.45 0.5
		Scale 5
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 5 5 5
